// Citywide effect: e.g., a station-wide aquaculture overhaul making food more affordable
if (typeof Q.syncProsperityDisplays === 'function') { Q.syncProsperityDisplays() }
!}

The Order's grandest project since the stakeholder's revolt: fitters dispatched to every tank on the station, sharing the craft that their great-grandparents died defending.  Even the Big 3 would have to hire them, and hate every minute of it.

